    "markdown": "# pandas.DatetimeIndex.hour#\n\n- \n*property* DatetimeIndex.hour[source]#\n- The hours of the datetime. Examples >>> datetime_series = pd.Series( ... pd.date_range(\"2000-01-01\", periods=3, freq=\"h\") ... ) >>> datetime_series 0 2000-01-01 00:00:00 1 2000-01-01 01:00:00 2 2000-01-01 02:00:00 dtype: datetime64[ns] >>> datetime_series.dt.hour 0 0 1 1 2 2 dtype: int32",
